      "content": "• Known as the 'Father of Indian Unrest'."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uw03qhk",
      "content": "• Gave slogan 'Swaraj is my birthright and I shall have it'."
    },
    {
      "id": "6loixx2",
