      "level": 2,
      "content": "Lala Lajpat Rai (1865–1928)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2p5yt5o",
      "content": "• Known as 'Punjab Kesari'."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xdhft1o",
      "content": "• Leader of Lal-Bal-Pal trio."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ywaayck",
      "content": "• Died after injuries during Simon Commission protest."
    },
    {
